      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So... you're taking on the Dead Lord's Labyrinth?\r\nThen allow me to tell you more about that place.",
        "Jp" : "――そう、《死王の迷宮》に挑むのね\r\nならあの場所についてもう少し話をさせて"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286501,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Deep within the labyrinth, there's an altar\r\nfor worshiping the King of the Underworld.\r\nLegend has it that a Spectral Knight resides there,\r\nguarding a cursed relic.",
        "Jp" : "迷宮の奥には冥界の王を祭る祭壇があり、\r\n呪われた秘宝とそれを守る亡霊騎士が\r\nいるという伝説があるの"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286502,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Many grave robbers in Zoma have entered that\r\nlabyrinth in search of the relic.",
        "Jp" : "ゾマで発掘や墓荒らしをする多くの人間が\r\n秘宝を求めてあの迷宮へ足を踏み入れた"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286503,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, none who entered have ever returned.\r\nNot even the one I once loved...",
        "Jp" : "でも、探索に行った人は全員帰らなかった\r\nかつて私が愛した人も――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286504,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ever since, the entrance has remained sealed.\r\nFor anyone weaker than him would surely perish.",
        "Jp" : "それ以来、あの迷宮の入り口は閉ざしていたの\r\nあの人より弱い人が入っても\r\n無駄死にするだけだもの"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286505,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, you might be able to reach the relic.\r\nShow me that you can finish what he could not.",
        "Jp" : "でも貴方なら、秘宝に辿りつけるかもしれない\r\nあの人ができなかったことを、やって見せて"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286506,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
