      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Welcome back! What happened\r\nat the Dead Lord's Labyrinth...?",
        "Jp" : "そうね、そのうちに――\r\n貴方なら《死者の丘》最大の謎、\r\n\"亡霊騎士と呪いの秘宝"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286507,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Right, I see... So the Spectral Knight itself was\r\nthe cursed relic's true form... That was its true identity.",
        "Jp" : "――そう、なるほどね\r\n\"亡霊騎士\"そのものが呪われた秘宝の\r\n正体だったってわけ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286508,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, only those who defeat the Ghost Knight\r\nreceive a reward, and all who are defeated\r\nbecome trapped inside the labyrinth... \r\nAs undead soldiers to guard the relic\r\nalongside the knight itself.",
        "Jp" : "亡霊騎士に打ち勝った者のみが\r\n見返りを手に入れ、\r\n破れた者は迷宮に囚われ騎士と共に\r\n秘宝を守る亡者の兵となる――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286509,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That means one of those among the undead\r\nthat you defeated may have been my love...",
        "Jp" : "なら、貴方が倒した亡者の中に\r\nあの人がいたのかもしれないわね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286510,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Then, I thank you... Because of you,\r\nI can finally let go. In a way, it seems that\r\nI was also trapped inside that labyrinth...",
        "Jp" : "ありがとう、お陰でなにかふっきれたわ\r\n迷宮に囚われていたのは\r\n私も同じだったのかもね――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286511,
      "MsgType" : 0,
